# Keep the build context small and secrets out of images.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.rdb
# Docs stay out, except the design tokens that packages/tokens builds from.
docs/*
!docs/02-design
docs/02-design/*
!docs/02-design/design-tokens.json
assets/references
apps/mobile
